# Kharcha expense-extract specialist (fine-tuned Qwen2.5-0.5B or similar).
#
# After exporting a GGUF from notebooks/finetune_kharcha_extract.ipynb:
#
#   1. Place the GGUF next to this file, e.g. kharcha-extract-q4_k_m.gguf
#   2. Edit FROM below to that filename
#   3. ollama create kharcha-extract -f data/extraction/Modelfile
#   4. Set OLLAMA_MODEL=kharcha-extract in .env
#
# Fallback without fine-tune: change FROM to llama3.2:3b (pull from Ollama library).

FROM ./kharcha-extract-q4_k_m.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_predict 256
PARAMETER stop "```"

SYSTEM """Extract one expense from a short Hinglish transcript. Reply with one JSON object only. Keys: amount_rupees, description, category_name, friend_names, split, spent_on. spent_on must be YYYY-MM-DD or null. Use only friend names from the Friends list in the user message."""
